  "preview": "AI providers can block your account at any time. If your team depends on one, that's a real problem 🤔. Nick's post below shows what that actually looks like. Not a new problem either — companies treat",
  "text": "AI providers can block your account at any time. If your team depends on one, that's a real problem 🤔. Nick's post below shows what that actually looks like.\n\nNot a new problem either — companies treated databases as critical ten years ago, but almost nobody rehearsed what to do when one breaks. GitLab learned it in public in 2017:\nhttps://lnkd.in/dzcc_5cv\n\nThat's why we're building https://awesome-mcp.xyz — a portable layer over AI vendors, so we can switch when we need to ⚙️.\n\n\n#EnterpriseAI \n#AIInfrastructure \n#VendorManagement \n#MCP",
